                    1045.9998779296875,
                    431.0
                ],
                [
                    1045.9998779296875,
                    588.0
                ],
                [
                    166.0,
                    588.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. An employee serving as of December 27, 1986, in a title higher than a title reclassified to a lower job grade effective December 28, 1986, who is reduced in grade for other than disciplinary reasons to the title reclassified lower shall be placed in the job grade for that title which existed on December 27, 1986.",
